OL,3,GNEWSATikTok is 'glorifying' motorbike
OL,4,Acrime, MP warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has called on TikTok to take
OL,7,Faction against social media accounts he
OL,8,Fsays "glorify" crimes including
OL,9,Fmotorbike theft and dangerous and
OL,10,Fillegal behaviour on the roads.
OL,12,FJeevun Sandher, who represents
OL,13,FLoughborough, said he was concerned the
OL,14,Ffirm, and other tech companies, were
OL,15,Fallowing content that normalises
OL,16,Fcriminal behaviour.
OL,18,FThe Labour MP said he had written to
OL,19,FTikTok asking for six accounts, linked
OL,20,Fto the LE11 Loughborough postcode area
OL,21,Fhe represents, to be removed from their
OL,22,Fplatform.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
